{"id":"e_tape","lemma":"étape","pos":"noun","rank":1791,"glosses":["stage, stop (on a journey)","leg (of race)","step, stage"],"ipa":"/e.tap/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/73/Fr-%C3%A9tape.ogg/Fr-%C3%A9tape.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"étapes"},"formAudio":{"étapes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b4/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-%C3%A9tapes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'est une grande étape.","en":"It's a big step.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"big","l":"grand"},null]},{"text":"Quelle est la prochaine étape ?","en":"What's the next step?","words":[{"g":"which?"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"upcoming","l":"prochain"},null]},{"text":"Je ne veux pas brûler les étapes.","en":"I don't want to jump the gun.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to burn"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Allons-y étape par étape.","en":"Let's take it step by step.","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"there"},null,{"g":"through"},null]},{"text":"Laissez-moi vous en noter les étapes !","en":"Let me write down the steps for you.","words":[{"g":"to leave","l":"laisser"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"to note"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]}]}